---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, links } from '../site.config';
import { experience, education, certifications, skills, resumePdf } from '../resume';
import { url } from '../utils';
---

<Base title="About" description={`About ${site.name}: experience, education, and how to get in touch.`}>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <!-- First draft written from the résumé. Rewrite it in your own voice. -->
  <p>
    Hi, I’m Skyy. I’m based in Columbus, Ohio, and I’ve taken a non-traditional path: the Army, warehouses
    and e-commerce, policy research, teaching people to fly a 737 simulator, and now training AI models.
  </p>
  <p>
    The common thread is figuring out how complicated things work and explaining them clearly, whether that’s a
    flight procedure, a policy brief, or why a language model got an answer wrong. I like solving messy problems,
    paying attention to details, and bringing teams together around them.
  </p>
  <p>
    I just finished my A.A. in International Studies, I’m working toward my private pilot certificate, and I’m
    always building something. This site is where I keep track of all of it.
  </p>

  <h2 class="label">Experience</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {experience.map((job) => (
      <li>
        <div>
          <strong>{job.role}</strong> · {job.org}
          {job.summary && <p>{job.summary}</p>}
        </div>
        <span class="meta label">{job.start === job.end ? job.start : `${job.start}–${job.end ?? 'Now'}`}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <h2 class="label">Education</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {education.map((e) => (
      <li>
        <div><strong>{e.title}</strong> · {e.org}</div>
        <span class="meta label">{e.year}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <h2 class="label">Certifications</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {certifications.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}
  </ul>

  <h2 class="label">Skills</h2>
  <dl class="skills">
    {Object.entries(skills).map(([group, items]) => (
      <>
        <dt class="label">{group}</dt>
        <dd>{items.join(' · ')}</dd>
      </>
    ))}
  </dl>

  <p class="resume-links">
    {resumePdf && <a href={url(resumePdf)}>Résumé (PDF)</a>}
    {links.filter((l) => l.label === 'LinkedIn').map((l) => (
      <a href={l.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">More on LinkedIn →</a>
    ))}
  </p>

  <h2 class="label">Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    The best way to reach me is{' '}
    {links.map((l, i) => (
      <>{i > 0 && (i === links.length - 1 ? ' or ' : ', ')}<a href={l.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{l.label}</a></>
    ))}.
  </p>
</Base>

<style>
  .skills {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .skills dt {
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .skills dd {
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 30rem) {
    .skills {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.1rem;
    }
    .skills dd {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
  .resume-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
